    "Facts are kept separate from conclusions. Results are compared with control requests from the same check rather than with fixed thresholds, so the method works across networks, carriers and VPNs." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Facts are kept separate from conclusions. Results are compared with control requests from the same check rather than with fixed thresholds, so the method works across networks, carriers and VPNs."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Факты отделены от выводов. Результаты сравниваются с контрольными запросами той же проверки, а не с фиксированными порогами, поэтому метод работает в разных сетях, у разных операторов и с VPN."
          }
        }
      }
    },
